---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Investment Banking — Hayden Smith" description="Where I want to go next.">
	<section class="wrap intro">
		<a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Back to the beach</a>
		<p class="eyebrow">Investment Banking</p>
		<h1>Where I want to go next.</h1>
	</section>

	<section class="wrap body">
		<p class="big">
			Research taught me to ask whether the market has mispriced something. Investment banking is where that question gets attached to a deal, a client, and a deadline — where the analysis has to hold up not in a classroom, but in a room with people who've done this a hundred times.
		</p>

		<p>
			I like the parts of finance that don't have a clean answer yet: building a model that has to survive someone poking every assumption, figuring out what a business is actually worth when the comps don't quite fit, working fast enough that the analysis is still relevant by the time it's needed. Coordinating a 15-person team against a fixed deadline for Greek Sing and defending a DCF for a stock pitch turned out to be the same muscle — hold the standard high, move fast anyway, and be honest about what you don't know yet.
		</p>

		<p>
			What I want out of investment banking specifically is exposure to real transactions and the teams that execute them — the chance to learn the mechanics of a deal from people who are exceptional at it, in an environment where the bar is high enough that coasting isn't an option. I'd rather be the least experienced person in a room that's actually doing the work than the most experienced person in a room that isn't.
		</p>

		<p class="placeholder">
			[Add specifics here: which groups/product areas interest you and why, any deals or transactions you've followed closely, and what from your recruiting conversations has sharpened this.]
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.intro {
		padding-block: 1rem 2rem;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
	}

	.body {
		padding-block: 1rem 2rem;
	}

	.big {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		max-width: 42ch;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.body p:not(.big) {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	.placeholder {
		color: var(--sunset-deep);
		border-left: 2px solid var(--sunset);
		padding-left: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
</style>
